-- The Encouragement of Aliyah and Return (Temporary Provision) Law, 5786-2026, s 3: exemption of the
-- business income of a non-resident entity.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of the deposited transcription.
--
-- WHAT THIS SECTION DOES.  The business income of a non-resident entity ("חבר בני אדם תושב חוץ")
-- produced in Israel through the personal exertion of an immigrant or veteran returning resident "כאמור
-- בסעיף 2(א)", in tax years 2026 to 2030, is exempt, unless the entity asked otherwise, provided the
-- entity had no business income produced in Israel but for the exertion.  Unlike s 2, s 3 states no
-- ceiling: the whole of that income is exempt.  Two cases are carved out (s 3(b)): where the person is
-- a material shareholder in the entity, and, for a transparent corporation, the part of the income
-- attributed to a rights-holder who is an Israeli resident.
--
-- WHAT IS AN INPUT.  The entity's status and its items (il36-nouns.l4).
--
-- ASSUMPTION A4 (NOTES.md): the proviso, "לא הייתה הכנסה מעסק שהופקה בישראל אלמלא יגיעתו האישית", is
-- tested over the items supplied for the entity, of whatever year; the text does not say whether it is
-- tested year by year.
--
-- FORKS.  F7: unlike s 2(a), s 3 does not say "בעת שהיו תושבי ישראל"; whether the exemption reaches
-- income of the entity produced before the individual became a resident, or after the individual ceased
-- to be one.  F8: whether s 4, which says the Law's provisions do not apply "על יחיד", reaches the
-- entity's exemption.

§ `Section 3 — exemption of a non-resident entity's business income`

-- src:28 | (א) הכנסתו מעסק של חבר בני אדם תושב חוץ, אשר הופקה בישראל בשל יגיעתו האישית של עולה או תושב חוזר ותיק כאמור בסעיף 2(א), בשנות המס 2026 עד 2030, תהיה פטורה ממס, אלא אם כן חבר בני האדם ביקש אחרת, ובלבד שלאותו חבר בני אדם לא הייתה הכנסה מעסק שהופקה בישראל אלמלא יגיעתו האישית של העולה או התושב החוזר הוותיק.
@ref Encouragement of Aliyah and Return Law s 3(a), proviso (transcription line 28): "ובלבד שלאותו חבר בני אדם לא הייתה הכנסה מעסק שהופקה בישראל אלמלא יגיעתו האישית"
GIVEN `the items` IS A LIST OF `An item of an entity's business income`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 3(a) — the entity had business income produced in Israel apart from the exertion` `the items` MEANS
    any (GIVEN `the item` YIELD `the item`'s `produced in Israel` AND NOT `the item`'s `because of the personal exertion of the individual`) `the items`

-- Fork F7.
@ref Encouragement of Aliyah and Return Law s 3(a) (transcription line 28); s 2(a) "בעת שהיו תושבי ישראל" (line 18); fork F7
GIVEN `the readings` IS A `The readings`
      `the person`   IS AN `An individual`
      `the item`     IS AN `An item of an entity's business income`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 3(a) — the entity's item is of a time the exemption reaches, at the readings` `the readings` `:` `the person` `item` `the item` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the readings`'s `the reading of the residence of the individual in section 3`
    WHEN `an entity's business income is exempt only if produced while the individual was an Israeli resident`
    THEN `s 2(a) — the person was an Israeli resident on` (`the item`'s `the day it was produced`) `, at the readings` `the readings` `:` `the person`
    WHEN `an entity's business income is exempt whenever produced in tax years 2026 to 2030`
    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a case that turns on the residence of the individual in section 3 is declined`
    THEN `a rule that needs a concrete reading was handed a reading the text does not decide; resolve the readings first (il36-answers.l4)`

-- The part of an item that is exempt: the whole of it, less, for a transparent corporation, the part
-- attributed to rights-holders who are Israeli residents (s 3(b)(2)).
-- src:31 | (2) לגבי חבר בני אדם תושב חוץ שהוא תאגיד שקוף – לגבי חלק ההכנסה המיוחס לבעל זכויות בתאגיד שהוא תושב ישראל.
@ref Encouragement of Aliyah and Return Law s 3(b)(2) (transcription line 31)
GIVEN `the entity` IS AN `An entity`
      `the item`   IS AN `An item of an entity's business income`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 3(b)(2) — the amount of the entity's item left to the exemption` `the entity` `item` `the item` MEANS
    IF `the entity`'s `is a transparent corporation as section 1 of the Law defines the term`
    THEN max 0 (`the item`'s `the amount` MINUS `the item`'s `the part attributed to rights-holders who are Israeli residents`)
    ELSE `the item`'s `the amount`

-- THE EXEMPT BUSINESS INCOME of an entity in a tax year, at concrete readings.
@ref Encouragement of Aliyah and Return Law s 3(a), (b) (transcription lines 28-31); s 2(a) (line 18); s 4 (line 33)
GIVEN `the readings` IS A `The readings`
      `the person`   IS AN `An individual`
      `the entity`   IS AN `An entity`
      `the items`    IS A LIST OF `An item of an entity's business income`
      `the tax year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 3 — the exempt business income of the entity, at the readings` `the readings` `:` `the person` `entity` `the entity` `items` `the items` `in the tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    IF    NOT `s 2(a) — the person is an immigrant or a veteran returning resident who became an Israeli resident in the period` `the person`
       OR NOT `s 2(a) — the tax year is one the paragraphs list` `the tax year`
       OR NOT `the entity`'s `is a non-resident entity`
       OR `the entity`'s `the entity requested otherwise`
       OR `s 3(a) — the entity had business income produced in Israel apart from the exertion` `the items`
       OR `the entity`'s `the individual is a material shareholder in the entity`
       OR `section 4 reaches the entity's exemption`
    THEN 0
    ELSE sum (map `the amount of the entity's item left to the exemption` (filter `the item is exempt in the year` `the items`))
    WHERE
        `section 4 reaches the entity's exemption` MEANS
                `s 4 — the Law does not apply to the person, at the readings` `the readings` `:` `the person`
            AND `section 4 takes the entity's exemption away at the readings`
        `section 4 takes the entity's exemption away at the readings` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the readings`'s `the reading of section 4 and the exemption of an entity`
            WHEN `section 4 also takes away the exemption of section 3 for an entity's income earned through the individual`
            THEN TRUE
            WHEN `section 4 does not touch the exemption of section 3 for an entity's income`
            THEN FALSE
            WHEN `a case that turns on section 4 and the exemption of an entity is declined`
            THEN `a rule that needs a concrete reading was handed a reading the text does not decide; resolve the readings first (il36-answers.l4)`
        `the item is exempt in the year` `the item` MEANS
                DATE_YEAR (`the item`'s `the day it was produced`) EQUALS `the tax year`
            AND `the item`'s `produced in Israel`
            AND `the item`'s `because of the personal exertion of the individual`
            AND `s 3(a) — the entity's item is of a time the exemption reaches, at the readings` `the readings` `:` `the person` `item` `the item`
        `the amount of the entity's item left to the exemption` `the item` MEANS
            `s 3(b)(2) — the amount of the entity's item left to the exemption` `the entity` `item` `the item`
